# 🎯 Q-Circuit Studio — Implementation Plan
### The Ultimate Visual Quantum Circuit Designer for Qubit Tracer

---

## Vision

**Replace AlgoHub** with **Q-Circuit Studio** — a full schematic circuit editor where users can visually design quantum circuits on a structured grid canvas, get real-time simulation results, generate/write code, and use AI to build circuits from natural language. Every feature must be **dead simple to use** while being incredibly powerful under the hood.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Design Philosophy:** SilicoFeller's biggest flaw is its hard, confusing UI. We do the **opposite**:
> - **One-click gate placement** — click a gate, click a cell. Done.
> - **Instant visual feedback** — every gate drop shows Bloch sphere updates
> - **No hidden menus** — every action visible or one shortcut away
> - **Guided onboarding** — tooltips, hints, progressive disclosure
> - **Aligned with all 6 Qubit Tracer themes** via `--qt-*` CSS variables

---

## Naming

**Q-Circuit Studio** — short, clear, matches the existing `Q-` naming pattern (QTalk, Q-Vision, QMemo, QLive).

