#### `POST /circuit/validate` — Circuit Validation

```python
@app.post("/circuit/validate")
async def circuit_validate(data: dict = Body(None)):
    """
    Validate circuit for common issues:
    - Gates after measurement
    - Qubit index out of range
    - Missing measurements (for hardware)
    - Gate compatibility warnings
    """
    gates = data.get("gates", [])
    num_qubits = data.get("qubits", 1)
    issues = validate_circuit(gates, num_qubits)
    return { "success": True, "issues": issues, "valid": len(issues) == 0 }
```

